     ROM spal-4q-0.u1 @0x77BFF) is baked into the <charset id="spo_names"> below so
     the definition is self-contained and needs no ROM at runtime.
     Time tiles are stored units-first [CCu CCt SSu SSt M] -> M'SS"CC.
     Score tiles are 6 decimal digits units-first. -->
